        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The year is 2019</strong>, and Joey Virginia is a perfectly average young man leaving home for his first semester at college. Except he's half opossum! And he's the only animal person around! In this romantic comedy visual novel, you'll help Joey find friendship, find himself, and maybe even find love! Guide this lovable anthropomorphic possum through all sorts of fun college adventures:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study for class!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play tabletop role-playing games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act in a student film!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do some nude modeling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cry at a party!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potentially date one of<strong> six</strong> different cuties!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a mysterious secret ending...?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND MUCH, MUCH MORE!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995450/extras/fc0b2bf13388e40be5e8160211cff879.avif?t=1762109232\" width=1560 height=991 /></span></p>",
